  m_text: "Your goal is to complete the puzzles laid before you. To complete a puzzle,
    you must activate the necessary colored switches to activate the Exit Portal.
    To aid you, utilize the Profession abilities scattered across the island, which
    will grant you extraordinary abilities. \n\nTo get started, take a tour of the
    Isle of Practice. This realm provides a safe space for you to get familiar with
    the Isle of Passions and all its wonders.\n\nAs progress through this realm,
    remember that patience is key. There is always a solution to each problem before
    you. Best of luck.\n"
